Name: mutter
URL: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/mutter
Version: 51.1
Revision: 9134e3a5869ce232bf95b77519005865747ba603
Update Mechanism: Manual (https://crbug.com/503546519)
License: GPL-2.0
License File: LICENSE
Shipped: no
Security Critical: no

Description:
A Wayland display server and X11 window manager and compositor library.

This is only used in tests.

Local Modifications:
None. src/ is a pristine upstream release.

The Chromium ui-controls Wayland protocol (used by interactive_ui_tests) is
implemented in chromium/meta-wayland-ui-controls.c, outside of src/. It is
built against mutter's private headers and hooked into the compositor by
wrapping meta_wayland_compositor_new() at link time
(-Wl,--wrap=meta_wayland_compositor_new in BUILD.gn).

When updating to a new version, update the Revision above with the new commit hash,
and perform the following steps:
1. Run on_update.sh
2. Check in the generated files along with the changes for the update.
3. Make sure chromium/meta-wayland-ui-controls.c still builds against the new
   private headers.
